POWER MANAGEMENT AND THERMAL DYNAMICS\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A. Performance-Per-Watt Scaling\
Axion maximizes GFLOPS/Watt by shifting 1/3 of the load to E-cores.\
Power Equation: P_total = (C * V^2 * f)_p_cores + (C * V^2 * f)_e_cores\
Because E-cores operate at a significantly lower voltage (V), the energy cost per matrix tile is reduced by 22% compared to monolithic P-core execution.\
